    "On (default): every button tap, theme pick and toggle triggers a soft taptic click. Off: silent. Also respects the iOS system setting (Settings → Sounds & Haptics → System Haptics).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On (default): every button tap, theme pick and toggle triggers a soft taptic click. Off: silent. Also respects the iOS system setting (Settings → Sounds & Haptics → System Haptics)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé (défaut) : chaque tap, choix de thème ou bascule déclenche un léger clic haptique. Désactivé : silencieux. Respecte aussi le réglage iOS (Réglages → Sons et vibrations → Vibrations système)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
